e data from uploaded CSV. </div><div><br></div><div>In GSTAT, data is a table that contains long/lat and variable for interpolation (from uploaded CSV). <b><i>Coordianates</i></b> will make a grid from this data table. </div><div><br></div><div>Please let me know if my explanation is not clear enough. </div><div><br></div><div>My appreciation for your advice ;-) </div></div>"
